{"unit_id":"Menghuan1918__dsh-better-goal#feature-1","repo":"Menghuan1918/dsh-better-goal","commit":"559c23e5b62f5fac9b894ec2f4e93d3e52a14fc3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-better-goal 的功能「目标管理」：可通过 goal 工具或 /goal 命令查看、设定、编辑、暂停、恢复、完成和清除当前目标；设定会创建新的完整目标，恢复会保留已有状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tool.js:62-103","src/commands.js:1-20","src/commands.js:75-84"]}
